# This directory holds the cross-compiled `golantern` binary that
# `tauri.conf.json`'s `externalBin` entry expects. Populate it with
# `go build -o desktop/src-tauri/binaries/golantern ./cmd/golantern`
# (or the GOOS/GOARCH variant for cross-compilation) before
# `cargo tauri build`.
#
# Built binaries are intentionally not committed — see
# `desktop/src-tauri/.gitignore`.
